B. Web Deletion Requests
If you cannot access the Application, you may request account and data deletion by sending an email with your registered email address to yogeshwartiwadi@gmail.com with the subject line "Account Deletion Request". Upon verification, all your account data will be permanently deleted from our servers within 30 days.
5. Data Security
We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal information, including end-to-end HTTPS/TLS data encryption in transit and secure database rules on Cloud Firestore. However, please note that no transmission method over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure.
6. Children's Privacy
PocketSplit is not directed toward children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal identifiable information from children under 13. If we discover that a child under 13 has provided us with personal information, we immediately delete it from our servers.
7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this policy and updating the Privacy Policy link in the Application and Google Play Store.
